SUMMARY:BVT goes to Mitsuwa! [Take 2]
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nYou read 
 it right!\n\nBVT goes to Mitsuwa! Take Two!\nAs with traditional work week
 s\, people might usually feel like there's a mountain climb to reach Frida
 y\, or in most cases at least Thursday.\n\nThis time around\, BVT will loo
 k to make everyone's work week that much more less of a drag with a nuance
 d event centered around Japanese culture\, food\, and much more.\n\nJoin u
 s for BVTs "Take Two" segment of ***BVT goes to Mitsuwa!***
