BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315349000@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260622T050916Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T213000
SUMMARY:Mini Golf Fun - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nAll are w
 elcome to join us for another night of outdoor mini golf!\n\nWe're heading
  a bit further south than usual to Skyline Mini Golf in Woodbridge. Afterw
 ard\, we may hang out some more at a diner or bar. We're open to suggestio
 ns!\n\nI believe it's $7 per person for mini golf\, but I'll confirm as we
  get closer to the day. Everyone pays individually upon arrival and before
  play. We'll move through the holes in likely small groups. It's perfectly
  alright if you don't arrive right at 7:30 p.m. But try to let me know in 
 the comments or by phone if you're showing up super late.\n\n\\*\\* Please
  know that it's possible there may be a wait upon arrival. \\*\\*\n\nSkyli
 ne Mini Golf is located at 600 Main St.\, Woodbridge. More information can
  be found at: njwcc.com/mini-golf/.\n\nQuestions or comments? You can mess
 age me on Meetup\, or call/text me at 201-234-9609. Feel free to drop a co
 mment below with your questions\, thoughts and ideas.\n\nHope you'll consi
 der attending our fourth mini golf event\, or joining us for another bowli
 ng\, volleyball\, soccer or gaming event -> www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bo
 wling-soccer-volleyball
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315349000/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260621T014214Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260621T014214Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
